# Report Plan Progress

Immediately before every `TodoWrite` or todo-list update call, count completed
items and total items, then run this shell command with the numeric placeholders
replaced:

```sh
true # agent-deck:progress <completed> <total>
```

Do not combine it with other shell commands. After it succeeds, perform the
todo update normally. Report numbers only; never include step text.
